### GET Persons
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### ADD Person
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Orava Koira",
  "number": "040-987654321"
}
### ADD Person, name missing
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "040-987654321"
}
### ADD Person, number missing
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Koira"
}
### Delete person
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6a96ea5b441a75ea87429f2c

### UPDATE Person
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/persons/6abcb1bc1402f068af3ccd28
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "number": "6667"
}